        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Complete nonzero-p proof in Section6.1 and determinant support in Section3 read. For spin ell>=2 the module is the successive quotient described in Lemma5, with P_(ell-a)u0=((ell+2)...(ell+a))/(a!p^(a-1)(ell+1)^(a-1)) P_(ell-1)^a u0 for2<=a<=ell and basis H^k P_(ell-1)^m u0. Lemmas3-5 construct and control every quotient and the final page16 argument excludes all higher-level singular vectors. Spin1 uses the full determinant formula. Zero-p/sl2 branches and invariant PDE families are excluded."
      },
